1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Now the body is seen from a distance.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:11,000
The body is there, but where are you?

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Inside the body or where the seeing happens?

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,000
No need to decide.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Just notice.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Please raise your right hand and notice how your body moves over there.

7
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Please place your right hand on your left shoulder.

8
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Please raise your left hand and notice how your body moves over there.

9
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Please place your left hand on your right shoulder.

10
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Now let both your hands rest on your lap.

11
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:13,000
You may feel located in the body you see, or in the seeing itself, or nowhere clear.

12
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Just notice this without deciding.

